<mjml>
  <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF" width="660px">
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding-top="12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hello,&nbsp;*|FNAME|*</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          You have started opening a Tuleva Additional Investment Fund account for your company
          *|RECIPIENTNAME|*. <strong>We can open the account once the company's other shareholder has
          verified their identity.</strong>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          They can do this by logging in to Tuleva and filling in the same short questionnaire through
          this link:
          <a href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/onboarding/identity?language=en">pension.tuleva.ee/savings-fund/onboarding/identity</a>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Once the other shareholder has verified their identity, the account will be open and you will
          receive a confirmation email. You can then make your first contribution.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          We will never ask for your passwords or PIN codes by email or phone. If in doubt, open
          pension.tuleva.ee in your browser yourself or write to
          <a href="mailto:tuleva@tuleva.ee">tuleva@tuleva.ee</a>.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="0 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding-top="12px">
          Tõnu Pekk<br />
          Founder and fund manager at Tuleva
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/disclaimer_savings_short_en.mjml" />
    <mj-include path="./partials/footer_bottom_fund.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
